+  doesn't"): **a contract sentence saying "I ran X" is a claim of fact and must be true when
+  WRITTEN, not when convenient. Reusing a prior contract as a template silently imports its claims
+  along with its structure** — the claims are exactly the part that does not carry over.
+  ⚠ And running it was not a formality: the real lineage is **13 models, not the 10** the previous
+  batch's list held. Three carry none of the five names (`int_player_competition_benchmarks`,
